-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Original work
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

All source code, artwork and fonts in this repository are original to this project. No third-party code,
artwork or fonts are vendored or copied into it.

  - Logo, banner, badges, favicon (favicon.svg, favicon.ico, apple-touch-icon.png):
    assets/brand/, generated by assets/brand/generate.py; served copies in ui/public/
  - Service icons: ui/public/icons/ (one per service), generated by scripts/build_icons.py
  - Pixel font: scripts/pixelfont.py
  - Service categories: scripts/service_categories.json (this project's classification)
  - Screenshot: docs/images/dashboard.png (of this project's own user interface)

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Data derived from third-party works
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

  - src/emulator_ui/catalog.json contains service identifiers, service names and operation names
    derived from the API models in botocore (https://github.com/boto/botocore).
    Copyright Amazon.com, Inc. or its affiliates. Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

  - src/emulator_ui/inventory_baseline.json records item counts reported by a freshly started
    AWS Emulator (https://github.com/aws/aws-emulator), which is dedicated to the public domain
    under CC0 1.0 Universal.

